<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">ƐFƐ - Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">ƐFƐSƆ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan akà Bɛfɛsɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">ƐFƐSƆ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ɛfɛ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan akà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bɛfɛsɔ</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Uboboo a mbul nkam atàtwɛb utaaŋ abi là, Ndwà a nkööŋ a aklistɔ yàbulà mbɔɔn agyägyä kà Azi Minɔ̈ɔ̈r, ŋàbawà bàfàbel Türki a Azi. Ikööŋ byàkäl un'tüüb umwɛy, wɛɛ Ikööŋ a Ɛfɛsɔ kyàkäl anà làkoo aŋàsöönà. Abun, ntööm Pɔl kàkyer mbul tär uboo a un'sɛŋ awà utaaŋ a nkyeen yàtär yisal ande (Màt 19.1-20.1). Un'kaan akà Bɛfɛsɔ kab là 3.1 anà u kab là 4.1, ntööm Pɔl kàkäl u bɔlokà mpal kàsöön nde baar a Ɛfɛsɔ. Undiir awun ban'sà ba un'kaan awà mbwo mwɛy anà in'kaan bàfàbel naa « isɔ », anà in'kaan kàsöön nde baar a Filipe, Filɛmɔ anà Kɔlɔsay.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngwal a an'lɔɔŋ ande ikaswaŋà naa yà ntɔn kab a atääŋ amwɛy lan'söön iköŋ a bul. Isin a ndaa kyan'kyän a mbul a in'tye a Nzam ikwen mà « mutüüb indiir byanswà abyà u du anà u mɛɛn kan'kɔɔ a mfum mwɛy, Klistɔ ».</para>
  <para style="ip">Fà nsɛmà tii u ntsülà, an'lɔɔŋ a un'kaan awà màŋàkab itiir byeel byàkölàköl:</para>
  <para style="ip">Kà itiir kyàtàtwɛb, ungö kan'man nde ubwaŋ a Nzam kàkyer nde akà bi u mbwo a Yɛsu Klistɔ, un'söön wàmukyään isin a ndaa, muswaŋ naa Nzam kàtüüb aben baar mpa abà Ayudà anà Ayudà un'sɛŋ mwɛy wa, un'sɛŋ ande.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kà itiir kyàyweel, ntööm wàmulɔm akà atääŋ a in'kaan ande naa ba bàkäl uboo a un'tüüb awà unsà ubwaŋ a mɔ̈ɔ̈ akün, un'tüüb umwɛy anà Yɛsu Klistɔ. Abun, ya ibɔr ndaa a balàbal unsà un'tüüb abà ba awà anà baar bumwɛy, unsà iköŋ a aklistɔ, unsà bɔr, unsà Ikööŋ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muswaŋ un'sɛŋ a Nzam, ntööm wàmusyääl idiim, idiim itär: kyà ndür, Ikööŋ awà Yɛsu Klistɔ un'tswe, kyà ndwà awà Yɛsu Klistɔ un'kul a twɛrà. Kyakin, imɛnà naa un'tüüb watɛy isàkal naa aklistɔ mbääb a ndandaa anà yà ipepey yatɛy akà Mwol aba.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Pɔl, ntööm a Yɛsu Klistɔ unsà ukwen a Nzam, akà baar abà u Ɛfɛsɔ abà bà Nzam anà bàlää amu Yɛsu Klistɔ:<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Wɛy kab a ngway anà duu a Taaràbi Nzam anà Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ màkäl anà bɛ.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Indiir aŋàbwaŋ kipɛ Nzam u mbwo a Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Nsaak ikäl akà Nzam, Taarà Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ! Nde kisaak mukipà nsaak a dweelà yanswà u du amu Klistɔ. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Kusà a nkyeer a mɛɛn, Nzam kisɔ̈ɔ̈l itaan mukal bànde u mbwo a Klistɔ, ntɔn bi ikäl bà in'kyɛɛl anà ikɔ̈ɔ̈n an'pɛl u mii ande. Unsà ukwen ande, <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Nzam kilɔ̈ɔ̈n kusà mukal iywaaŋ nkà ande u mbwo a Yɛsu Klistɔ, mulab ukwen ande unsà ubwaŋ ande. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Abun, wɛy bi isyäŋà Nzam ntɔn kab a ntsà kipɛ nde amu Mwan ande wànkween.<verse eid="EPH 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Amu nde, u mbwo a an'kil ande, bi kàkyàtoo unsà isɔ, amu nde, bàkidwääl ibii abi, mulab un'naaŋ a kab a ngway a Nzam, <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>alà kikääb nde làŋàsöönà, mukipà an'yeerà manswà anà un'yɛnà wanswà. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Nde kipɛ mbwo muyöb ngyee a ukwen ande, ngyee kàlɔ̈ɔ̈n nde kusà unsà ubwaŋ ande, amu Klistɔ, <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>ntɔn mukölà ya u taaŋ a ntsüü: un'tüüb amu Klistɔ, nkyeer yanswà ayà u du anà ayà u mɛɛn.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Amu nde sye, bi kàwɛl kab làbi unsà an'kyän a mbuur afàsyen bya byanswà unsà ukwen ande, bi bisɔ̈ɔ̈l kusà, <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>ntɔn musyäŋà làkoo ande, bi baar kàsi làkyän kusà amu Klistɔ!<verse eid="EPH 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Amu nde sye, bɛ làkyàwem ndaa a ndandaa, Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ làfàlatswà mɔ̈ɔ̈. Amu nde sye, bɛ làsi làkwikilà anà bàlasi inyɛm a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl bàpɛ ilää, <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>mbööl a kwal abi tii u ntsuuŋ abi yà ntsüü ayà isàwal bi, ntɔn nsyäŋà a làkoo ande.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyamàkà a Pɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Kyakin, mɛ sye, fà kàwem mɛ làkwikilà abɛ amu Mwol Yɛsu anà ukwen abɛ ntɔn aŋin'kyɛɛl banswà, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>mɛ in'fàyɔn anki mufuur an'tɔɔn ntɔn bɛ, umpal in'fàlatà mɛ din u ngyamàkà amɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Wɛy naa Nzam a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ, Taa aŋàlàkoo, kàlapɛ dweelà a an'yeerà anà là imɛɛy ntɔn bɛ lun'yöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ, <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>wɛy nde uduub mpem abɛ u pɛɛlà ande, ntɔn bɛ làyöb naa làkyän nà alà mwo unsà làbeel ande, naa un'naaŋ a làkoo ande wà aben, kwal ufàlakääb nde anà aŋin'kyɛɛl, <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>unkaak a ngwal a kölàköl nà nde we awà ntɔn ubwaŋ abi, bi aŋàlàkwikilà. Ngwal ande ayi, nde ya kàtwey unsà unkaak a ngwal ande wanswà, <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>nde ya kàpɛ akà Klistɔ mpal kun'wiiy nde uboo a akü, anà kun'bwääy u kɔɔ ande là ibaal u du, <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>udu a imfum kyanswà, ikɔ̈b kyanswà, unkaak a ngwal wanswà, imwol kyanswà anà ikɔb kyanswà ban'kwo mutà din, kà nà u mɛɛn mà mpɛl anki, wɛɛ sye anà u mɛɛn amà isàyà. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Inye, Nzam kàsi indiir byanswà ungyɛl a in'kɔl a Yɛsu anà nde kun'pɛ akà Ikööŋ ntɔn mukal un'tswe a indiir byanswà. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Ikööŋ kya kyà ndür ande, nde awà ufàyööl Nzam ŋakwo a barbar.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Fà ukwà tii u mɔ̈ɔ̈</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Bɛ, bɛ làkäl bàŋàkwà ntɔn ibii anà man'be abɛ, <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>amà làkyerà bɛ umpal làyilabà bɛ nzam a mɛɛn mà, Mwan a mfum awà afyekyekà uboboo a du anà mɛɛn, dweelà làfàsal apanà uboo a baar a un'tswe ngwal. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Bi banswà sye, bi bàkäl un'lwaaŋ mwɛy anà baar abà, fà itaan, mulabà ngyal a ndür abi, bi bàkyerà ukwen aya, bàläbà an'kyän aya. Unsà imbuur, bi bàkälà baan a nkyɛl asànaa baar bumwɛy.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Wɛɛ, ntɔn Nzam wàŋàyɔl a ngyɛb, anà nde kikwen unsà ukwen a kölàköl, <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>umpal kàkäl bi bàŋàkwà ntɔn ibii abi, nde kipɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà Klistɔ Yɛsu - yà unsà kab a ngway waa bɛ làwü mɔ̈ɔ̈, <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>anà nde, nde kiwiiy anà kibwääy u du, amu Yɛsu Klistɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Kyakin, u mbwo a ubwaŋ ande ntɔn bi amu Klistɔ Yɛsu, nde kàkwen muswaŋ u mbul a in'tye ayà isàyà, un'naaŋ a kölàköl wà kab a ngway ande. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Abun, yà unsà kab a ngway waa bɛ làwü mɔ̈ɔ̈, u mbwo a làkwikilà. Bɛ làkyer anki akà undiir, wɛɛ la là kab a Nzam. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Ya kàyan'fà anki unsà isal, ntɔn mbuur uswɛŋ ngaal. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Ntɔn nde kikyer, nde kiyilà amu Klistɔ Yɛsu, ntɔn isal aŋàbwaŋ kàlɔ̈ɔ̈n Nzam kusà, ntɔn bi ikölà bya.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'sɛŋ mwɛy amu Klistɔ Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Kyakin, làyɔbà naa utaaŋ itaan bɛ làkäl anà idiim a baar mpa abà Ayudà u ndür abɛ, bɛ baar bàlabeelà baar mpa abà aŋàkyɛy, akà baar bàfàkyey uyɔl naa ba bàŋàkyɛy, ntɔn ba bye anà idiim a nkyɛɛy bàkyer baar u ndür aba. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Làyɔbà naa utaaŋ alanà, bɛ làkäl anki anà Klistɔ uboo a bɛ, bɛ làkwe anki mukal baan a Isàlɛl, bɛ làkäl angyey u nkwà yanswà yà ntɔn ilää, ukɔɔn làkyän anà ukɔɔn Nzam u mɛɛn. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Wɛɛ apanà, u mbwo a un'tüüb abɛ anà Klistɔ Yɛsu, bɛ baar làkälà ukwɛl, bɛ làkyàbulà tsütsü u mbwo a an'kil a Klistɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Abun, nde wà duu abi: nde kàbuul Ayudà anà baar mpa abà Ayudà un'sɛŋ mwɛy. U mbwo a ndür ande, nde kàbwaab ibä a nkaabà akyà un'yiiŋ. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Nde kàdwä un'kɔɔn anà nswɛɛŋ awa anà nsyääl awa. Abà, nde kàkwen naa fà Un'yudà anà mbuur mpa awà Un'yudà, nde ukyer mbuur mwɛy wàkün, mubiil duu, <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>anà mutüüb ba bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l ndür mwɛy, anà kàfuur un'tüüb aba anà Nzam. U mbwo a kulunsi, nde kàdwä iyiiŋ. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Nde kàyi mukyään duu akà bɛ baar làkäl ukwɛl, anà duu akà baar bàkäl tsütsü. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Kyakin, u mbwo a nde, amwɛy anà bamwɛy, unsà Dweelà mwɛy mpɛl, bi ibye anà mbwo mukɔlà apà Taa.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Abun, bɛ làfàkal anki angyey, itàkal alyaaŋ a mbwo, wɛɛ bɛ làbà aŋàbul mbwo mwɛy anà aŋin'kyɛɛl, baar a bɔr a Nzam. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Bɛ, bɛ bàkyàlabiil unsà ntööŋ, un'bään a ya antööm anà aŋangɔɔm, anà Klistɔ Yɛsu nde ŋakwo wà nkɔŋ a twɛrà. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Yà u mbwo ande, waa ndwà yanswà yàmutsim anà yàmuyɛl ntɔn mubulà idwà in'kyɛɛl unsà Mwol. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Amu nde, bɛ sye làbà mbwo mwɛy bàŋàbilà uboo a ntööŋ ntɔn mubulà ndwà a Nzam u mbwo a Dweelà.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Isal a Pɔl ntɔn baar mpa abà Ayudà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Kyakin, mɛ Pɔl, mbuur a bɔlokà a Klistɔ Yɛsu ntɔn bɛ, bɛ baar mpa làbà Ayudà, <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>mbalà yumwɛy, bɛ làkyàwem naa Nzam, unsà ngyɛb ande, kan'pɛ buur naa an'kyän ande màkwe ntɔn bɛ, <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>anà, u mbwo a imɛɛy, nde kan'mɛɛy ngyee, asànaa kàsön mɛ ya ikikye kusà. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Lan'taŋ bɛ, bɛ lan'kwo làmɛn naa un'yɛnà nà mɛ in'we awà muyöb ngyee a Klistɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Ngyee ayi Nzam ya kàmɛɛy anki akà baar a ngyääl yàlyaaŋ, asànaa kan'swaŋ nde ya apanà, u mbwo a Dweelà, akà antööm in'kyɛɛl ande anà aŋangɔɔm: <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>baar mpa abà Ayudà bàmakyey unsà kwal nsil alà, baar a ndür mwɛy nsil ayi, bàŋàtüüb unsà ilää nsil aki, amu Klistɔ Yɛsu, u mbwo a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ, <verse eid="EPH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>mɛ kàkyàbulà un'syääl u mbwo a kab a kab a ngway kan'pɛ Nzam musyäl unkaak a ngwal ande. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Mɛ in'wà kimbuur uboo a aŋikyɛɛl banswà, nde kan'pɛ kab a ngway mukyään un'naaŋ a Klistɔ wà ipepey akà baar mpa abà Ayudà, <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>anà musà unsà pɛɛlà naa Nzam afàkwey aben ngyee yàkäl aŋàyee fà itaan amu nde, nde Nkyer a indiir byanswà. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Ntɔn, fà apanà, Amfum anà Aŋikɔ̈b u du, bàyöb an'yeerà a Nzam mà ifà ifà, u mbwo a Ikööŋ, <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>asànaa mböön a mbul a in'tye kàkwey nde amu Klistɔ Yɛsu, Mwol abi. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Abun, amu nde, u mbwo a làkwikilà ande, waa bi ban'sà mpem anà kam aŋàkwo musin tsütsü apà Nzam. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Abun sye, mɛ amàlalɔm naa twon lan'kwamà ntɔn mpay in'manà mɛ ntɔn bɛ: ya yà làkoo abɛ.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwen a Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Lalan, in'fàbwà mɛ an'köm kusà a Taa. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Ikɔb a bɔr lanswà, u du anà u mɛɛn, ifàfà amu nde, <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>mulab un'naaŋ a làkoo ande, wɛy nde kàlapɛ ngwal, u mbwo a Dweelà ande, ntɔn imbuur abɛ akyà uboo ikäl aŋàtsim, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>wɛy nde ubwääy Klistɔ u mpem abɛ u mbwo a làkwikilà, wɛy bɛ làkäl bàŋàsà in'swɛy anà bàŋàtsim unsà ukwen, <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>waa bɛ làkal aŋàkwo muyöb, mbwo mwɛy anà aŋin'kyɛɛl banswà, naa ngyamà, uteer, bwɛl, iminà byà aben, <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>anà muyöb ukwen a Klistɔ ban'söön ngyööb yanswà, ntɔn bɛ làkäl bàŋàyuur tii muwal ngyööl a Nzam yanswà.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Apanà, akà nde akwà, u mbwo a unkaak a ngwal afàsal amu bi, kan'kwo mukyer indiir byàŋàsöön indiir byanswà ifàlɔm bi itàkal ifàyweer bi, <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>wɛy làkoo làkäl akà nde uboo a Ikööŋ anà amu Klistɔ Yɛsu, akà ngyääl yanswà, u mbul a in'tye! Wöwöö.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Un'tüüb a Ikööŋ amu Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Abun, mɛ Pɔl, mbuur a bɔlokà ntɔn Mwol, mɛ amàlabɔɔn, làpɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ akà làbeel làwɛl bɛ, <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>unsà làbɔ̈ɔ̈n lanswà, duu, anà nkääŋ a mpem. Làkääŋà mpem bɛ a bɛ unsà ukwen. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Làsi ngwal mukaar un'tüüb a Dweelà u mbwo a duu. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Ndür yà mwɛy anà Dweelà wà mwɛy, abun sye Nzam kàlabeel unsà làkyän làmwɛy mpɛl, <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Mwol mwɛy, làkwikilà làmwɛy mpɛl, ndüümà mwɛy mpɛl, <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Nzam mwɛy, Taarà a baar banswà, awà udu a baar banswà, afàsal u mbwo a baar banswà, anà afàkal amu baar banswà.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Wɛɛ mbuur mbuur amu bi kàwɛl kab a ngway asànaa kà isii a kab a Klistɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Kyakin bàtɛɛnà naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">« Nde kàbeenà du,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">nde kàkör baar a bɔlokà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">nde kàpɛ an'kab akà baar. »<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Kyekà, « Nde kàbeenà », ikaswaŋà aben? Imɛnà naa nde sye kàtàtyà tii u ngyɛl a mɛɛn. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Mbuur awà kàtyà, mbuur nsil wa sye kàbeenà du aŋàlyaaŋ du lanswà, ntɔn muyööl indiir byanswà. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Wà nde nsil wa kàbuul amwɛy antööm, bumwɛy aŋangɔɔm, apaay Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ, aseey anà alɔɔŋ, <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>ntɔn mupà aŋin'kyɛɛl inwään byàŋàkwo mukwey isal ntɔn mutɔŋ ndür a Klistɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Tii kunà isàbulà bi banswà un'tüüb mwɛy unsà làkwikilà anà unsà ngyööb a Mwan a Nzam, unsà indweer, asànaa Klistɔ unsà ngyööl ande. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Abun, bi ifàsàkal anki asànaa ambɛy, bàŋàsɛk, bàŋàtàtɔɔm tɔɔm a un'pöb a an'lɔɔŋ a baar a loor anà impeen aba mubwiy baar ndwaŋ. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Wɛɛ, mukyään ndandaa unsà ukwen, bi isàyɛl unsà indiir byanswà ntsü akà Klistɔ awà un'tswe. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Yà u mbwo ande waa ndür yanswà ayà swalaa, yàŋàtüüb ubwaŋàbwaŋ u mbwo a nkɔn aya, ntɔn mupà mbwo akà itiir a ndür imwɛy imwɛy musal isal a kya, ntɔn muyɛl anà mutɔŋ ya ŋakwo unsà ukwen.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɔ̈ɔ̈ uboo a Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Le ayà in'tɛn mɛ anà in'tà mɛ imbäl kà ikɔb a Mwol: twon lan'fàkal asànaa baar mpa abà Ayudà, ntɔn un'yɛnà aba ndöŋ yatɛy. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>An'kyän aba mà u mpib anà ba sye bà angyey u mɔ̈ɔ̈ a Nzam, ntɔn nkɔ̈ɔ̈n a ngyööb ifàtwaal bwoor u mpem aba. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Unsà nkɔ̈ɔ̈n a an'kyän aba, ba bàkyàbilà unsà ipasàsɛ anà bàkyàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈ aba unsà ŋingyäy ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ntsüü anà unkaam.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ Klistɔ làlɔŋàkà anki abunà, <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>kya isàkal naa ndandaa bɛ làkyàwem naa bàyäm ntɔn nde, isàkal naa nde bàlalɔŋ, unsà ndandaa ayà amu Klistɔ, <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>làpiy nkääl abɛ yà itaan anà làkɔɔb imbuur abɛ kyà itaan akyà ifàbwà u mbwo a ngyal a loor. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Wɛy bɛ làfurà bàkün unsà dweelà a un'yɛnà abɛ, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>anà làbwäär mbuur akün, awà bàkyer asànaa kàkwen Nzam unsà balàbal anà un'kyɛɛl abyà ifàfà u ndandaa.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Abun, bɛ làbà aŋàlwomà unsà loor: wɛy mbuur mbuur utɛn ndandaa akà mbääb ande, ntɔn bi ibà atɔŋ bi a bi. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Nkye bɛ làbà u nkyɛl? Twon lan'kyer man'be, twon lan'kal u nkyɛl tii mpal làkàminà taaŋ. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Twon lan'pà ipöl akà ileŋ. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Wɛy mbüüb ukɔ̈ɔ̈n afàyib, wɛɛ nde usi ngwal musal unsà lää kà an'kɔɔ ande ŋakwo, ntɔn nde umɛn undiir akab akà mbuur awe anà ngyal awa. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Wɛy ndaa a nsɔɔr ikɔ̈ɔ̈n atoo u mun abɛ. Wɛɛ, kya ngyal isàkal, làtɛn ndaa aŋàbwaŋ, yan'kwo mutɔŋ anà mupà kab a ngway akà baar bàweemà ya. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Twon lan'pà Dweelà In'kyɛɛl ngyɛb, Dweelà kàlasi Nzam asànaa inyɛm, ntɔn ilä a ntsuuŋ. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Wɛy naa itsumbuun, umpɔr, nkyɛl, an'sye anà in'tswe, bya byanswà byàdiimà amu bɛ anà ube banswà. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Làkäl bàŋàbwaŋ bɛ a bɛ, làkäl anà nkääŋ a mpem, làdwääl nkul bɛ a bɛ, asànaa kàladwääl Nzam amu Klistɔ.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ukal uboo a pɛɛlà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Làläb Nzam, ntɔn bɛ làbà baan ukwen nde. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Làkäl unsà ukwen, asànaa Klistɔ kikwen nde anà kàpɛ nde mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ŋakwo akà Nzam ntɔn bi, asànaa an'kab anà ibɔɔn asànaa may a usɔŋ aŋàbwaŋ.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Itàkal ipasàsɛ, ŋingyäy ifà ifà, ngyal a indiir byanswà, ikal anki akà ikikye uboo a bɛ, ya ikal abun sye ntɔn aŋin'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Kà yà ubwaŋ anki mutɛn indiir inaŋ anà unsil itàkal itetɛɛn, wɛɛ yà ubwaŋ mufuur an'tɔɔn taaŋ lanswà. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Ntɔn, làyöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa mbuur wanswà afàkyer ipasàsɛ, ndaa a nswɛn itàkal unkaam - ikaswaŋà naa itɛk - usàwal anki kwal unsà Imwol a Klistɔ anà kyà Nzam.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Akà mbuur mwɛy twon kàmàlakur unsà ndaa a bunàbun: ntɔn indiir abi byàfàkàwool nkyɛl a Nzam udu a aŋin'tswe ngwal. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Abun, twon lan'tüüb a baar a tub abà. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Itaan, bɛ làkälà u làpib, wɛɛ ŋàbawà bɛ làbà pɛɛlà amu Mwol. Làkäl asànaa baan a pɛɛlà. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Ntɔn imbɛŋ a pɛɛlà kyà: ubwaŋ, balàbal anà ndandaa. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Làsɔ̈ɔ̈l ndaa ifàpà un'sak akà Mwol. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Twon lan'bilà unsà isal a mpib ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ndöŋ, wɛɛ làtwey bya u leŋ. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Ntɔn indiir bàfàkyer baar abà u nku, yà nswɛn musam bya. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Wɛɛ indiir byanswà ufàmɛɛy pɛɛlà, byàfàmɛnà kà ipöl, <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>ntɔn undiir aŋàmɛɛy wanswà wà pɛɛlà. Kyakin bàfàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">« Wiyà, ngye mbuur awabɔ̈ɔ̈nà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">mbarà uboo a akü,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">waa Klistɔ usàtà inyäŋ amu ngye. »<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ unsà nkääl abɛ, twon lan'mɛnà asànaa bɛ làbà insil, wɛɛ làkäl baar a an'yeerà, <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>abà bàfàsyääl taaŋ alà ubwaŋ, ntɔn ilä byà ibe. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Abun, twon lan'kal asànaa baar bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n un'yɛnà, wɛɛ làyöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa ukwen a Mwol bà aben.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Twon lan'yɔr man, ma màfàbwiy baar ndwaŋ. Wɛɛ làkäl aŋàyɔl a Dweelà. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Làlɛɛl bɛ a bɛ u mbwo a an'diim a nsyäŋà anà an'diim a ikwɛŋ. Làtɔ̈l an'diim anà lun'syäŋà Mwol u mpem abɛ wanswà. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Utaaŋ lanswà, ntɔn indiir byanswà, làfuur an'tɔɔn àkà Nzam Taa kà ikɔb a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akyay anà adim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Bɛ baar làfàpà Klistɔ làzir, làkäl unsà làbɔ̈ɔ̈n bɛ a bɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Akaar, lawem adim abɛ asànaa làfàwem bɛ Mwol. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Ntɔn un'dim wà mfum a un'kaar, asànaa Klistɔ awà nde Mfum a Ikööŋ, nde wà un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ a Ikööŋ akyà ndür ande ŋakwo. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Wɛɛ, asànaa Ikööŋ ifàsà kya Klistɔ làkoo, wɛy akaar sye bàwem adim aba unsà ndaa yanswà.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Adim, lakwen akyay abɛ asànaa Klistɔ kàkwen nde Ikööŋ anà kàpɛ nde mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ŋakwo ntɔn kya. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Abà, nde kàkwen mubuul kya kyà in'kyɛɛl anà mupöŋ kya u mbwo a an'dà anà u mbwo a Ndaa. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Nde kàkwen naa kya ikäl asànaa nde ŋakwo, ntsà, ukɔɔn kitwan, itàkal un'bɔɔ, itàkal too làmwɛy. Nde kàkwen naa Ikööŋ ande ikäl kyà in'kyɛɛl anà ikɔ̈ɔ̈n an'pɛl. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Undiiràwun, un'dim akyer akwen un'kyay ande asànaa ndür ande ŋakwo. Mbuur afàkwen un'kyay ande, afàkwen sye nde ŋakwo. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Ntɔn, akà mbuur mwɛy watɛy afàyiiŋ ndür ande ŋakwo, wɛɛ nde akyer afàdii anà afàlɔɔn ya ubwaŋàbwaŋ asànaa ufàkyer Klistɔ ntɔn Ikööŋ ande. <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>Nkye bi kà ibà itiir a ndür ande anki? <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>« Kyakin baal asàwɛy taarànde anà ngwän, waa usàkàbääb anà un'kyay ande. Ba bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l bàsàbulà ndür mwɛy. » <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Ngyee ayi yà yàkölàköl: mɛ, mɛ an'tɛn naa ya yà ntɔn Klistɔ anà Ikööŋ. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Itàkal naa abà, wɛy mbuur mbuur uboo a bɛ ukwen un'kyay ande asànaa nde ŋakwo, wɛy un'kaar upɛ un'dim ande làzir.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Baan anà aböör</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Baan, lapɛ aböör abɛ làzir, unsà Mwol, ntɔn ya ndaa a balàbal. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>« Sà làkoo akà taaràŋà anà akà ngwa », yà nswɛɛŋ atàtwɛb aye anà ilää: <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>« ntɔn ngye akäl unsà un'sak anà u mɔ̈ɔ̈ a bwɛlàbwɛl u mɛɛn. »<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Bɛ, aböör, twon lan'pà mpem a nkyɛl akà baan abɛ, wɛɛ labɔŋ mukapà an'lɔɔŋ aŋàbwaŋ anà an'lwɛŋ man'fà akà Mwol.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɔ anà ankum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Asɔ, lapɛ ankum abɛ u mɛɛn mà làzir unsà bɔɔmà anà matɛɛr, u mpem a làbɔ̈ɔ̈n, asànaa bɛ làbàmuweemà Klistɔ, <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>kà nà u mii aba mpɛl anki, asànaa bɛ làkwen mumɛnà bàŋàbwaŋ u mii a baar, wɛɛ asànaa asɔ a Klistɔ mukyer ukwen a Nzam, fà mpem aba. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Lasyääl unsà mpem aŋàbwaŋ, asànaa bɛ làbàmusyääl Mwol, wɛɛ kà baar anki. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Làyöb naa mbuur mbuur asàwal kà an'kɔɔ a Mwol bweel a ubwaŋ abà kàkyer nde, itàkal un'sɔ, itàkal mbuur a nsaay.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Wɛ bɛ, ankum, làkyer sye ifà imwɛy akà ba. Twon làmapà unkiiŋ, ntɔn bɛ làkyàyöb naa bɛ anà ba, làwe Mwol nsil wa u du anà nde ufàsà anki nsɔ̈ɔ̈l uboo a baar.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">An'tà ufàpà Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Mumay, làwɛl ngwal abɛ unsà Mwol anà unsà ikɔ̈b a ngwal ande. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Làbwäär an'tà a Nzam, ntɔn bɛ làkäl aŋàkwo munwaan anà ikikyer a ileŋ. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Bi inwaan anki ngwiy a an'kil anà in'twaŋ, wɛɛ anà Amfum, Aŋikɔ̈b, Aŋàlàyaal u mɛɛn a mpib, anà an'dweelà an'be amà u du. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Kyakin, làbwäär an'tà a Nzam manswà, ntɔn bɛ làwɛl iböŋ kà ilä ibe anà làkäl aŋàtsim ungö mukyer indiir byanswà.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Làtsim, làbwäär ndandaa asànaa un'di a lɔŋ, balàbal asànaa undiir afàtii itɔl, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>anà un'kanà akyään Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ là duu asànaa idyäär kà in'kɔl. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Udu a indiir byanswà, làkwɛy làkwikilà asànaa làbää làfàdim mbaa a mba yanswà ufàlom Mbuur un'be. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Mumay, làwɛl mpà a ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà kɔm a Dweelà, ikaswaŋà naa ndaa a Nzam. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>U mbwo a ngyamàkà yanswà anà ndɔ̈ɔ̈m, làyamà taaŋ lanswà unsà Dweelà. Làtyeel an'taaŋ unsà muküünà u ngyamàkà ntɔn aŋin'kyɛɛl banswà, <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>anà ntɔn mɛ sye, ntɔn Nzam usi u mun amɛ ndaa an'kwo mɛ musyäl ntɔn mukyään a ngwal ngyee a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Itàkal naa apanà mɛ in'wà u bɔlokà, mɛ in'wà un'kyeey a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ alà. Làyamà ntɔn mɛ in'kyään la anà un'kanà wanswà, ukɔɔn bɔɔmà.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr a ntsüü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Mɛ in'kwen bɛ sye làyöb naa mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ wà aben, anà ayà in'fàkyer mɛ. Tishik, un'tɔŋ awà in'fàkwen mɛ, un'syääl a lää unsà Mwol, ayàlakyään Làsaŋ lanswà. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Undiiràwun wa mɛ amàlatööm awà, ntɔn nde kàlasam naa bi kà ibà aben anà kàlapɛ un'kanà.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Wɛy Taa Nzam anà Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ bàpɛ duu, ukwen anà làkwikilà akà atɔŋ banswà. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Wɛy kab a ngway a Nzam làkäl akà baar banswà bàfàkwen Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ unsà ukwen mpa bàfàbi.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
